he revised submission"},{"id":248925395,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_ctu","indicator_name":"Provided additional Information for clarity, transparency, and understanding","value":"No previous submission available"},{"id":248925671,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_ctu","indicator_name":"Provided additional Information for clarity, transparency, and understanding","value":"Yes, enhancement in the revised submission"},{"id":248925960,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\u003cp\u003e\"The Philippines intends to undertake GHG (CO\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003ee) emissions reduction of about 70% by 2030 relative to its BAU scenario of 2000-2030. Reduction of CO\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003ee emissions will come from energy, transport, waste, forestry and industry sectors. The mitigation contribution is conditioned on the extent of financial resources, including technology development and transfer, and capacity building, that will be made available to the Philippines.\"\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe INDC also includes a section on Adaptation. See full INDC for more information.\u003c/p\u003e"},{"id":248926234,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"“The Philippines commits to a projected GHG emissions reduction and avoidance of 75%, of which 2.71% is unconditional and 72.29% is conditional, representing the country’s ambition for GHG mitigation for the period 2020 to 2030 for the sectors of agriculture, wastes, industry, transport, and energy.”\u003cbr\u003e The First NDC also includes an adaptation component.\u003cbr\u003e\"The Philippines, in line with its national security policy and its sustainable development aspirations and in solidarity with ASEAN Member States, shall endeavor to peak its emissions by 2030 in the context of accelerating the just transition of its sectors into a green economy and the delivery of green jobs and other benefits of a climate and disaster-resilient and low carbon development to its people, among others.”"},{"id":248926542,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\"The Philippines' 2026 NDC (NDC 3.0) sets an economy-wide net GHG emissions reduction and/or avoidance target (including FOLU) of 75% (7% unconditional, 68% conditional on international support) for 2025-2035 against projected business-as-usual cumulative emissions, covering energy, transport, IPPU, agriculture, waste and FOLU. With all identified measures the country projects to be a net sink over 2025-2035. Anchored on CBDR-RC and climate justice, with adaptation as an anchor strategy.\""},{"id":248926689,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248926965,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248927273,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248927398,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"About 70% reduction in GHG emissions by 2030 compared to the BAU scenario of 2000-2030"},{"id":248927646,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"75% reduction in GHG emissions compared to the BAU scenario of 2020-2030, of which 2.71% is unconditional and 72.29% is conditional"},{"id":248927954,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"The Philippines commits to a net emissions reduction and/or avoidance target (including FOLU) of 75% (7% unconditional and 68% conditional upon international support) for the period 2025-2035 against projected business-as-usual cumulative emissions."},{"id":248928096,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Baseline scenario target"},{"id":248928368,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PHL","country":"Philippines","glob